und. The\nneighbourhoods were chosen for the diversity and the finished piece is designed to\nexpress a sense of movement and reflect the heterogeneity of this small Ontario\ncity. Produced by CFRC Volunteers.","subject":"radio art;Radia;CFRC","licenseurl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/","publicdate":"2010-09-21 21:12:29","addeddate":"2010-09-21 20:52:17","uploader":"radia.fm@gmail.com","updatedate":"2010-09-21 21:12:55","updater":"Radia.fm","boxid":"OL100020612","backup_location":"ia903606_17","date":"2010-07-19","radiaseason":"23","creator":"CFRC","external_metadata_update":"2019-04-12T03:52:23Z"},"server":"ia600203.us.archive.org","uniq":55762939,"workable_servers":["ia600203.us.archive.org","ia800203.us.archive.org"]}